# Return to the Light Realms: "Return all nonland permanent cards from your graveyard to the battlefield." The three Black
# Lotuses that paid for it return together; Consider's instant card and the Island it surveilled into the graveyard stay
# there (a land card is a permanent card, but not a nonland one), and so does the sorcery itself.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Return to the Light Realms
Consider
Island
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

[Actions]
[Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Consider.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Island)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Consider; Island
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Return to the Light Realms.Cast
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Black Lotus; Black Lotus; Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard = Return to the Light Realms; Consider; Island
